config BOOTMAP
	bool "Draw the boot as a live treemap on the EFI framebuffer"
	depends on X86 && EFI
	select TRACEPOINTS
	select KALLSYMS
	help
	  Draw one box for each initcall on the UEFI GOP framebuffer, and fill
	  each box when its initcall completes. /proc/bootmap gives the boxes
	  to the userspace daemon, which continues the picture.

	  See utils/bootmap in seanorepo. If unsure, say N.
